  "goodToKnow": "Die Entsorgung is waste disposal: die Entsorgung von Altöl, Elektroschrott, Sperrmüll (bulky items like furniture, collected by appointment). Germany has an elaborate sorting system: Restmüll, Biomüll, Papier, Gelber Sack (packaging) and bottles via Pfand (deposit). Der Wertstoffhof is a recycling centre. Entsorgen means to dispose of, literally to free from worry (Sorge). The search for a nuclear waste site (Endlager) continues. It has no plural."
